{
  "uid": "surgeguard-overview",
  "title": "SurgeGuard \u00b7 1. Overview",
  "description": "Is everything OK, and is the waiting room protecting your origin? Health at a glance.",
  "tags": [
    "surgeguard",
    "observability"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 5,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Overview \u2014 Is everything OK, and is the waiting room protecting your origin?\n\n| **[1. Overview](/grafana/d/surgeguard-overview?{__url_time_range})** | [2. Queue & Admission](/grafana/d/surgeguard-queue?{__url_time_range}) | [3. Backends & Traffic](/grafana/d/surgeguard-backends?{__url_time_range}) | [4. Reliability & Recovery](/grafana/d/surgeguard-failure?{__url_time_range}) | [5. Infrastructure](/grafana/d/surgeguard-resources?{__url_time_range}) | [6. Protected vs Unprotected](/grafana/d/surgeguard-comparison?{__url_time_range}) |",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Overall Status",
      "description": "Cluster health signal: HEALTHY = Redis up + Worker leader + API up + healthy backends. Click to drill down into Reliability.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "clamp_max(  (max(redis_up{job=\"redis\"}) or vector(0))  + (max(surgeguard_worker_is_leader) or vector(0))  + clamp_max(max(surgeguard_backends_healthy) or vector(0), 1),  2) * clamp_max(  (max(up{job=\"surgeguard-api\"}) or vector(0))  * (max(redis_up{job=\"redis\"}) or vector(0)),  1)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "\u2014",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#ef4444",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#10b981",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "#ef4444",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "DEGRADED",
                  "color": "#f59e0b",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "HEALTHY",
                  "color": "#10b981",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Drill down: Overall Status",
          "url": "/grafana/d/surgeguard-failure?{__url_time_range}",
          "targetBlank": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Waiting now",
      "description": "Visitors currently in the FIFO waiting room. Click to view Queue & Admission.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(surgeguard_queue_length) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#10b981",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#f59e0b",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "#ef4444",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Drill down: Waiting now",
          "url": "/grafana/d/surgeguard-queue?{__url_time_range}",
          "targetBlank": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Admitted / s",
      "description": "Measured rate of admitted visitors (of N configured). Green when admission is actively issuing tokens.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(surgeguard_admissions_total[$rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
